: "中国大陆", "actor": "李璐璐、李梦然", "director": "周潇", "content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, &quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">该剧改编自时代漫王同名漫画，围绕女主苏绿夏（李璐璐 饰）绑定女配逆袭系统，穿梭不同小世界执行任务展开。讲述了苏绿夏绑定女配逆袭系统，穿越千万小世界，扭转炮灰女配命运、平息怨气。她凭智慧与演技花式吊打渣男贱女，如在后宫世界拆穿重生女主柳如烟阴谋，助养子登基成太后；在攻略顾南城的世界，面对其觉醒的意识，她察觉神秘力量线索，与顾南城（李梦然 饰）从对立到合作，联手削弱并击败神秘力量。过程中她还寻找零的灵魂碎片以图复活，全程 “虐渣” 不断，爽感十足的故事。</span></p>", "episodes": [{"name": "第01集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202601/20/17PkybfatR97/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第02集", "url": "https://v2.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv2/202601/20/P0xbQmN63D92/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第03集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202601/20/VTGgqdtRwr90/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第04集", "url": "https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202601/20/AqRzSf52X889/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第05集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202601/20/7cEuuzgkiB95/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第06集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202601/20/9d4r11iVBs95/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第07集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202601/20/yqzY2pHYhn93/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第08集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202601/20/mL9wqNPvTb97/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第09集", "url": "https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202601/20/Np1zdA2BTt94/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第10集", "url": "https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202601/20/nEqXF5Ghkn96/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第11集", "url": "https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202601/20/hPtGJFVMj589/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第12集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202601/20/waSnxMVPHv94/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第13集", "url": "https://v12.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv12/202601/20/bfGDm1qNH396/video/index.m3u8"}, {"name": "第14集", "url": "https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/